## What I built
A native, Apple-idiomatic parity of `web/.../status/LiveStatusPill.tsx` — a pure presentational capsule chip:
- **`LiveStatusPill.swift`** — tinted `Capsule` (fill·0.1 + ring·0.3), status dot (pulsing only on `reconnecting`, reduce-motion honored), SF-Symbol glyph (`waveform.path.ecg`/`wifi`/`wifi.slash`), state label, middot, `updated <relative>`; combined `.updatesFrequently` VoiceOver element with composed aria-label.
- **`.Model.swift`** — `LiveStatusState` tone map, `LiveStatusRelative.bucket` ladder (`nil`→"—", floor + clock-skew clamp + non-finite guards), `LiveStatusPillStrings` i18n facade, `Equatable`/`Sendable` presentation.
- **`.Telemetry.swift`** (P1/S11 `view.opened`), **`.Previews.swift`** (all states, light/dark, Dynamic Type), **`.strings`** (P1/S10 catalog), **`.Tests.swift`** (26 XCTest cases).

